**版本号：**
3.8.1

**问题描述：**
ApiSelect分页加载接口重复请求

**原因**
```
watchEffect(() => {
        props.immediate && fetch();
        props.immediate && console.log('ApiSelect immediate change');
  });
```
中`props.immediate`与`handlePopupScroll`相冲突，每次滚动加载后`watchEffect`中`props.immediate`始终为`true,`将再次请求。

**错误截图：**

![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad0991bc-7b01-4a11-8dba-97e01af0aa24)

**友情提示：**
修改为以下用法即可
```
watch(
        () => props.immediate,
        (newval) => {
          newval && fetch();
        },
        {
          immediate: true
        }
      );
```

**效果**

![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42c29a72-bcef-4a53-a56d-0f6e49af7220)

